# Insert these directives inside EACH existing pixelprowlers.io/www site block,
# before its current reverse_proxy. Preserve existing TLS and other directives.
# DO NOT replace the complete Caddyfile with this snippet.
@backend_confinement path /graphql /graphql/*
respond @backend_confinement "Formulaires temporairement indisponibles. Merci de revenir ultérieurement." 503
